{"id":"u-e0450fee-a152-40d5-a354-14fa834a5f82","src":"community","title":"Powerlifting RPE 3-Rep Block","author":"drew S.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/FCKSpz-untitled-spreadsheet","desc":"This program increases the RPE (7,8,9) for the first 3 weeks and then you test either your 3RM or 1rm on week 4. Take a deload week after testing. This is a high-volume program, make sure your diet, sleep, and recovery are all on point, otherwise you will burn out. Come into your workouts with a goal every day, and then smash it. You should be looking forward to your top set all day.\n\nThis is a program I made for myself that works well for me. \nIm a intermediate powerlifter whose been lifting for 4 years. \n\nThis researched and homemade program has gotten me a 500lb deadlift, 275 bench, and 425 squat. I will continue to use it on myself and make changes according to my body.\n\nI hope someone can use this program to help them learn the basics of programming for powerlifting based on RPE.","level":["Intermediate","Novice","Advanced"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":5,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-29T05:28:31.796Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Bench Primary / Push","Deadlift Primary / Pull","Squat Primary / Deadlift Secondary / Legs","Bench Secondary / Upper","Squat Secondary / Lower"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8},{"r":5,"rpe":8},{"r":3,"rpe":8}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":8}